Output ./assets/lsp-document-symbols.gif

Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 13
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600

Type "nvim Taskfile.yaml" Sleep 500ms Enter
Sleep 500ms

Type ":Telescope" Sleep 500ms Enter
Sleep 250ms

Type "lsp_document_symbols" Sleep 500ms Enter
Sleep 500ms

Down
Sleep 500ms

Enter
Sleep 1s
